### Insert five sample products (run each request once).
### Login using PRODUCT_SUPERUSER_EMAIL / PRODUCT_SUPERUSER_PASSWORD in your ignored .env.
### Paste the resulting token below. Direct access to product-service is superuser-only for writes.

@pbUrl = http://localhost:8091
@suToken = PASTE_PRODUCT_SUPERUSER_TOKEN_HERE

### Login superuser (copy token from response into @suToken above)
# @name su
POST {{pbUrl}}/api/collections/_superusers/auth-with-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identity": "product-admin@katalogku.local",
  "password": "PASTE_PRODUCT_SUPERUSER_PASSWORD_HERE"
}

### 1. Kemeja Batik Parang
POST {{pbUrl}}/api/collections/products/records
Authorization: {{suToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Kemeja Batik Parang","description":"Kemeja batik motif parang, bahan katun.","category":"fashion","price":25,"rating":4.6,"stock":40,"thumbnail":"https://picsum.photos/id/21/300"}

### 2. Kopi Gayo 250 gr
POST {{pbUrl}}/api/collections/products/records
Authorization: {{suToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

